gothic   \" id=\"SE-af58f061-7805-4016-b087-fdb9d3325c56\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-90bc9428-be32-4c18-8f4c-8b3aedd29d4f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7c52192c-3f51-4c50-9c23-9c59acedfe96\">게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f54bf900-902c-4a46-87cb-bb80026c9b5c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ee3b2cb7-9a3e-480a-be03-ff88abd56308\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fa5108a3-3a5e-4716-8aae-72ae2c70ab4d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7141e1f0-6818-44ef-b21b-1ec7ca89b261\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c791859a-be75-4815-b955-9752c1b33328\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-78e77d48-d91f-4ac9-a951-38071f53b791\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-70585deb-a90b-4e9f-86a1-85cd0a8b7243\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d637e30a-128e-4fe7-9545-f8f13d607a2f\"><b>📢 8/13(목) 무점검 업데이트 안내</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b45ce832-06f9-4f0d-adfe-f4722d1c9bd6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-159ad6ba-2baa-453f-bc1c-121e6e4ad72e\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a6fd874-d947-4f3b-ac6c-31a8615ad7ab\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a8877dd9-982f-4c89-8959-9b477b229a8c\"><b>✔️ 일시</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ef9c0640-f406-4182-a2a9-d7a692541f1c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-0fe39069-de1a-4613-998d-4b14a220bc6f\">- 8/13(목) 16:30 ~ 18:40 경</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cc873536-3822-4a71-866f-a8ecd321155b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e78ddfd5-f912-4456-aa0a-255d1ffb11e3\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d208ab6f-cbb1-45e9-87d6-10d78b295a0e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5e7dd4ce-077b-4eb8-819f-84401bb6a5a2\"><b>✔️ 내용</b></span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-87d894d2-c2b9-4c91-83f2-9678e6d6f89b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c08f554e-6d7d-478c-8c75-5304dc3433c3\">1. 하모니 큐브 「렐릭 디바이드」 착용 시, 브래디 스킬1 「론리 구르메」의 나누고 싶은 맛 효과가 적용되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2a7cef00-8a38-4d83-b610-342b01688482\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-516e64bd-cafe-463e-9ba1-a9128386f67e\">2. 솔로 레이드 뮤지엄 - 하베스터의 몬스터 정보에서 아이콘이 잘못 표시되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3503b80d-5888-4f82-aa60-356f5ec4cdea\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f74dd9fd-9342-4e45-9249-a5872877d04e\">3. 솔로 레이드 뮤지엄에서 하베스터와 전투 중, BGM이 의도와 다르게 재생되는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7f84a8c7-da40-420e-bb00-218a830ced4f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c7c9b949-ccd2-4023-948f-7697979eb767\">4. 일부 캠페인 스테이지가 정상적으로 클리어되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a6c555b-aa26-4305-b911-bcf392b9ffbd\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-007ad671-77a0-4142-a2fa-ef146a45349c\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a5bd620-0dac-42c5-bcc8-52f07ad55f65\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f0e0c522-d2b8-4aeb-98e8-847f49e23515\">※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8714dd31-4285-4682-9e63-468ccdfc4686\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5d95a661-c5a2-49e7-88e4-3d598e63c7e1\">※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1cd17e48-1ef2-4be6-af4f-653afd2ce26a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-712b6733-6217-4aae-b613-a281bc4c71bc\">·····················································································</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e70954bf-8bab-45f1-8dea-7b9edb6e3098\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cc161122-3822-4bd0-91ab-282aeb26b2f0\">​</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d43f3a2d-f5b0-480f-bb50-189dec07eb39\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2fbfad47-c9d5-46be-903a-fdb80cf06f37\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p>\n<!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-a98c8c6d-0bfb-4b1e-96ec-e19a9679dcc7\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-192a08b4-1cdc-44ba-a619-0eccc1b93ee6\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-normal\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\" style=\"max-width:100px;\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata='{\"id\" : \"SE-192a08b4-1cdc-44ba-a619-0eccc1b93ee6\", \"src\" : \"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA4MTNfMjY2/MDAxNzg2NjEwMzg1NzM1.fFv7TiqsiMZFB-44o5duSKLCcxXKWnyWYT-NUzKTCrkg.FEVxirOoqeh7m7p9AVvr_QbBy2TfIMR2EjBEfQaMYFAg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.png?type=w1678\", \"originalWidth\" : \"100\", \"originalHeight\" : \"100\", \"linkUse\" : \"false\", \"link\" : \"\", \"fileSize\": \"19573\" }'>\n                                        <img src=\"https://nng-phinf.pstatic.net/MjAyNjA4MTNfMjY2/MDAxNzg2NjEwMzg1NzM1.fFv7TiqsiMZFB-44o5duSKLCcxXKWnyWYT-NUzKTCrkg.FEVxirOoqeh7m7p9AVvr_QbBy2TfIMR2EjBEfQaMYFAg.PNG/241030_%EC%97%85%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8_100x100.p